    <textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_0p3dszi">
      <text>The MPON sents the dismissal to the MPOO.
The MPOO reviews the dismissal.
The MPOO opposes the dismissal of MPON or the MPOO confirmes the dismissal of the MPON.</text>
